meta {
  name: 02_DedicatedScopesAndPostRevoke
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: An administrator is managed with the dedicated scopes and revoked through POST

    Given the assistant is not an administrator for the bostyrer
    And the bostyrer adds the assistant with the dedicated write scope
    And the bostyrer sees the assistant with the dedicated read scope
    When the bostyrer revokes the assistant through POST administrators/delete
    Then the assistant is no longer listed
}
